cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproduction, please cite the original OoO-Spec paper."
title: "OoO-Spec: Out-of-Order Semantic Speculation for Fast Tool Calling (independent reproduction)"
abstract: >-
  Independent, from-scratch reproduction of the OoO-Spec method: a frozen
  Qwen3-0.6B + LoRA sidecar that predicts tool-call function and argument slots
  out of order, integrated asynchronously with a ToolSpec target decoding loop.
  This repository is not the authors' official implementation.
type: software
